{"At \00310:20\004 there was a gentle tap on the door and, like the fairy godmother, Mr. Harrison reappeared.\n“I hope you both enjoyed a good night’s sleep,” he ventured.\n“Couldn’t have been better,” said William, after he’d drained his coffee.\nNot much chance of that when you’re married to a caveman, Beth wanted to tell him, but kept her thoughts to herself.","Hidden in Plain Sight","Jeffrey Archer",true},
