{"He checked on Anderson and saw she was still sleeping like a stone. Gardener had decided to wake Bobbi up by \003ten-thirty\004 if she hadn’t awakened on her own.","The Tommyknockers","Stephen King",true},
{"“So be it, then,” replied the count; and extending his hand towards a calendar suspended near the chimney piece, he said, “today is the 21st of February”, and drawing out his watch, added, “it is \003exactly half past 10 o’clock\004. Now promise me to remember this, and expect me on the 21st of May at half past 10 in the forenoon.”","The Count of Monte Cristo","Alexandre Dumas",true},
